OL,3,GNEWSANo final decision on Hogsmill
OL,4,Astepping stones
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners say they are optimistic
OL,7,Fabout the future of popular stepping
OL,8,Fstones at a Surrey beauty spot, after
OL,9,Fthe Environment Agency (EA) confirmed
OL,10,Fthat no final decision had been taken
OL,11,Fon removing them.
OL,13,FIn July it was announced that the
OL,14,Fstones on the Hogsmill River at Ewell
OL,15,Fshould be replaced with a new
OL,16,Ffootbridge, after fears about public
OL,17,Fsafety were raised.
OL,19,FEpsom and Ewell Borough Council said it
OL,20,Fwas exploring options "for restoring
OL,21,Fand maintaining safe access", with
OL,22,Ffunding for a new bridge upstream.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
